      "content": "thanks for this. it looks pretty professional. i checked the score on that formula i mentioned (the one that counts the values), and it's a bit lower than i was hoping. i think a higher score would give me a better much better chance of getting past the initial bot filter.\n\ncan you try another version? i still want it to sound human, but try to lean into those values a bit more. i really need that score to be higher to make sure the ATS doesn't just toss my resume in the trash. can you bump up the frequency of those specific keywords without making it look super obvious?",
